{"parentUuid":"4c1723b9-d081-4e56-9560-9888ee744a33","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aafcddf4215ab99e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hbw7XG8meP8P2UfDLZuHpg","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"CaDiCaL\" \"2.1\" OR \"2.2\" release date 2025 LIDRUP IPASIR-UP proof\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"cadical/NEWS.md at master · arminbiere/cadical\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/arminbiere/cadical/blob/master/NEWS.md\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · arminbiere/cadical\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/arminbiere/cadical/releases\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - ipasir2/ipasir2_solver_cadical: CaDiCaL SAT Solver with IPASIR 2 Support · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ipasir2/ipasir2_solver_cadical\"},{\"title\":\"Available CAV Evaluation Artifact Reusable CAV Evaluation Artifact CaDiCaL 2.0\",\"url\":\"https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFazekasFleuryFroleyksPollitt-CAV24.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"CaDiCaL 2.0 | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-65627-9_7\"},{\"title\":\"CaDiCaL 2.0 | Computer Aided Verification\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1007/978-3-031-65627-9_7\"},{\"title\":\"CaDiCaL 2.0 Armin Biere1,2(B) , Tobias Faller1 , Katalin Fazekas3\",\"url\":\"https://cca.informatik.uni-freiburg.de/papers/BiereFallerFazekasFleuryFroleyksPollitt-CAV24-Springer.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Revisiting DRUP-Based Interpolants with CaDiCaL 2.0 | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_5\"},{\"title\":\"IPASIR-UP: User Propagators for CDCL Katalin Fazekas # TU Wien, Austria\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol271-sat2023/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.8/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.8.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - liveontologies/cadical4j: Accessing the native CaDiCaL SAT solver throught IPASIR interface and its Java binding · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/liveontologies/cadical4j\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about CaDiCaL releases with LIDRUP and IPASIR-UP features:\n\nCaDiCaL has a major IPASIR-UP increment that includes added support to generate incremental proofs (LIDRUP) while using IPASIR-UP. However, the search results do not provide specific release dates for versions 2.1 or 2.2 in 2025.\n\nThe GitHub releases page shows that LIDRUP proofs now include information about queries that returned with UNKNOWN result, which appears to be a feature in the latest releases.\n\nTo get more precise information about the exact release dates for CaDiCaL versions 2.1 and 2.2 in 2025, you would need to check the official CaDiCaL GitHub repository's releases page directly or the project's NEWS file, as the search results do not contain the specific 2025 release dates you're looking for.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"0a6677af-82d5-4b06-9fe0-bafe4d078ec2","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:16.356Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4c1723b9-d081-4e56-9560-9888ee744a33","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a2fc6a3c-9ffe-45dd-89d6-1b8d4b0bf9b8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aafcddf4215ab99e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q8KmYCxHLgGNj4uyAqko1c","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Nukala\" pseudo-boolean to clausal proof translation FMCAD 2024\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Formal Methods in Computer-Aided Design 2024 Translating Pseudo-Boolean Proofs\",\"url\":\"https://repositum.tuwien.at/bitstream/20.500.12708/200790/1/Nukala-2024-Translating%20Pseudo-Boolean%20Proofs%20into%20Boolean%20Clausal%20Proofs-vor.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"reposiTUm: Translating Pseudo-Boolean Proofs into Boolean Clausal Proofs\",\"url\":\"https://repositum.tuwien.at/handle/20.500.12708/200790\"},{\"title\":\"Proceedings of Formal Methods in Computer-Aided Design, FMCAD 2024\",\"url\":\"https://repositories.lib.utexas.edu/items/b5e164a4-863e-4a20-b12e-72a34d136f72\"},{\"title\":\"PROCEEDINGS OF THE 24TH CONFERENCE ON FORMAL METHODS IN COMPUTER-AIDED DESIGN – FMCAD 2024 - TU Wien Academic Press\",\"url\":\"https://www.tuwien.at/academicpress/en/product/proceedings-of-the-24th-conference-on-formal-methods-in-computer-aided-design-fmcad-2024-ebook/\"},{\"title\":\"24th FMCAD 2024: Prague, Czech Republic\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/db/conf/fmcad/fmcad2024.html\"},{\"title\":\"Clausal Proofs for Pseudo-Boolean Reasoning⋆\",\"url\":\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~mheule/publications/tacas22-pb.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Translating Pseudo-Boolean Proofs into Boolean Clausal Proofs\",\"url\":\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~mheule/publications/PBIP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Accepted Papers · FMCAD 2024 :: Formal Methods in Computer-Aided Design\",\"url\":\"https://fmcad.org/FMCAD24/accepted/\"},{\"title\":\"Program · FMCAD 2024 :: Formal Methods in Computer-Aided Design\",\"url\":\"https://fmcad.org/FMCAD24/program/\"},{\"title\":\"PBLib – A Library for Encoding Pseudo-Boolean Constraints into CNF | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-24318-4_2\"}]\n\nI found the paper you're looking for! The paper \"Translating Pseudo-Boolean Proofs into Boolean Clausal Proofs\" was authored by Nukala, Choudhuri, Bryant, and Heule in 2024, and it was published in the Proceedings of the 24th Conference on Formal Methods in Computer-Aided Design – FMCAD 2024.\n\nBased on the paper content, a PBIP file describes a sequence of transformations on a set of pseudo-Boolean input constraints leading to an infeasible constraint, describing an unsatisfiability proof for a PB constraint problem. The PBIP proof and CNF file are inputs to PBIP-CHECK, which translates the PBIP proof to LRAT using a proof-generating BDD package.\n\nThe paper appears to be available as a PDF from the Vienna University of Technology repository at https://repositum.tuwien.at/bitstream/20.500.12708/200790/1/Nukala-2024-Translating%20Pseudo-Boolean%20Proofs%20into%20Boolean%20Clausal%20Proofs-vor.pdf\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9d97cc51-5e37-4045-98f5-493e45d6907c","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:17.099Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a2fc6a3c-9ffe-45dd-89d6-1b8d4b0bf9b8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9d97cc51-5e37-4045-98f5-493e45d6907c","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aafcddf4215ab99e7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01R7ftRPuHG87zQLVSQnBvwj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have plenty of high-signal data now. Let me synthesize the report.\n\n---\n\n# SAT/UNSAT 证明工具链调研 (2024-2026)\n\n## 1. 格式演化时间线\n\n| 年代 | 格式 | 含义 | 关键特性 |\n|------|------|------|----------|\n| ~2003 | RUP | Reverse Unit Propagation | 只列学到的子句，验证靠重做 UP |\n| ~2013 | DRUP | Deletion RUP | RUP + 删除标记 |\n| 2014 | DRAT | Deletion + RAT | SAT Competition 标准格式（至 2024） |\n| 2017 | LRAT | Linear RAT | **带 hint**（前因子句 ID 链），让验证器跳过 UP 搜索；可被形式化验证 |\n| 2018 | LPR | LRAT + PR clauses | LRAT 向后兼容超集，支持 propagation redundancy |\n| 2017 | GRAT | Two-pass | gratgen 生成、gratchk 验证；专为速度设计 |\n| ~2022 | FRAT | Friendly RAT | 中间格式，DRAT/LRAT 之间的桥 |\n| 2023-2024 | **IDRUP / LIDRUP** | (Linear) Incremental DRUP | **CaDiCaL 2.x 标配**；为 incremental SAT（IPASIR-UP）设计；LIDRUP = IDRUP + 子句 ID + hint |\n\n## 2. 当前主流检查器（2024-2026 实测数据）\n\n| 工具 | 输入 | 验证器实现 / 形式化基础 | 速度 (overhead vs 求解) | 状态 |\n|------|------|--------|--------|------|\n| **drat-trim** | DRAT | C，**未验证** | ~180% overhead | 经典基线，Heule 维护 |\n| **gratchk + gratgen** | DRAT→GRAT | Isabelle/HOL 验证（gratchk） | 比 drat-trim 快 ~1.6×，比 LRAT 快 ~1.7-3× | 成熟 |\n| **lrat-check** (Coq) | LRAT | Coq 提取 | 相对慢 | 学术 |\n| **acl2-lrat** | LRAT | ACL2 验证 | LRAT 中最快 | 成熟 |\n| **cake_lpr** | LRAT/LPR | **HOL4 → CakeML → 机器码全链路验证** | 比 acl2-lrat 慢 ~1.3×；2025-02 又提速 5-10%、二进制缩 20%；2024-03 起原生支持二进制 LRAT/LPR | **SAT Comp 2020+ 官方审计工具** |\n| **lrat-trim** (Pollitt/Fleury/Biere SAT'23) | LRAT | C，未验证 | LRAT 检查 ~30% overhead，远低于 DRAT 180% | CaDiCaL 配套 |\n| **lidrup-check** | LIDRUP | C，未验证 | 专为增量 SAT；hint 让验证近线性 | Biere 维护，配 CaDiCaL 2.x |\n| **VeriPB + CakePB** | PB augmented → kernel | VeriPB 不验证，CakePB 用 CakeML 验证 kernel | SAT Comp 2025 唯一 PB 选项需两者串联 | PB-OPT 标准 |\n| **Carcara** | Alethe (SMT) | Rust，未验证（但有 Lean/Isabelle 重建） | cvc5/veriT 用；6.5k LOC | 成熟 |\n| **PBIP-Check** (Nukala/Bryant/Heule FMCAD'24) | PBIP→LRAT | 用 BDD 重写到 LRAT | 把 PB 证据降到 SAT 验证栈 | 新桥 |\n| **IMPCHECK** (Schreiber SAT'24) | 在线 LRAT | C + SipHash 签名 | **on-the-fly 检查**，不写盘，签名跨进程传递；MallobSat 用 | 分布式新范式 |\n\n## 3. SAT Competition 2024/2025 现状\n\n- Main track 强制要求 UNSAT 证书；DRAT 仍可接受但 **LRAT 是首选**\n- **审计走双层**：cake_lpr（机器验证）+ drat-trim/lrat-trim（高吞吐）\n- 2025 PB 赛道：5h 验证预算、强制 VeriPB 格式、CakePB 必须能复核 kernel\n- 没有\"双求解器\"硬性规则；安全靠 **多条件验证（不同 trust base 的检查器）**\n\n## 4. CaDiCaL 2.x 输出能力\n\n- **2.0** (CAV'24，Biere 等) — 引入 LRAT 原生输出；放弃 DRAT 中间步\n- **2.1.x** — 加 IPASIR-UP + LIDRUP；加 propagator 接口\n- **2.2.x** — LIDRUP 可记录 UNKNOWN 查询；新统计接口\n- 触发：`--lrat`、`--lidrup`、`--frat`，二进制 vs ASCII 都可\n- 文件大小：DRAT 二进制比 ASCII 小 ~3×；LRAT 含 hint 通常更大但**验证快得多**\n\n## 5. 70×70 placement 的 SAT proof 估算\n\n公开数据没直接对应 70×70 工厂布局的样本。可用 SAT Comp 趋势外推：\n- Heule \"5-color Schur\" 类组合证明已达 **TB 级 DRAT**\n- 工业 BMC 案例典型 LRAT 单 instance 几 GB 到几十 GB\n- 我们的 master CP-SAT 模型若展开成 CNF：266 强制实例 + 70×70 grid + 路由约束 → 估 **数百 MB 到数 GB LRAT**（单候选）。一次完整 campaign 整套候选 → **TB 级**，必须用 lrat-trim 裁剪\n\n## 6. CP→SAT 证明桥接现状\n\n- OR-Tools 自带 `drat_writer.h`，但只在底层 SAT 内核可用，**不能给 CP-SAT 全模型出证明**（外部约束、表约束等没在 DRAT 范围内）\n- VeriPB 走另一条路：把 CP/PB → PB 证据 → 经 PBIP 翻成 LRAT → cake_lpr 收尾\n- **结论**：我们短期不可能从 CP-SAT 直接出端到端可验证证明；要么 (a) 把关键判定下沉到 PB/SAT，要么 (b) VeriPB 路线（与 Round 3/5 调研一致）\n\n## 7. GPU 加速\n\n- **没有成熟 cuDRAT/GPU-LRAT**。Osama et al. 在 GPU 内做 inprocessing 时附带产 DRAT，但**检查仍在 CPU**\n- 实际加速来自 **on-the-fly + 分布式**（IMPCHECK 路线），不是单机 GPU\n- 短期不值得投资 GPU 检查器\n\n## 8. 工业 case\n\n- **Amazon Zelkova / Tiros**（AWS 网络/IAM 防火墙）— 用 SMT，背后是 z3，证据走 Alethe / Carcara\n- **Intel / AMD** 硬件验证 — 大量 BMC 用 DRAT/LRAT 审计\n- **Mallob/MallobSat** 五次拿 SAT Comp Cloud 金牌，IMPCHECK 是其可信化方案\n- Lean 4 社区 PBLean 把 VeriPB 证据导入 Lean 形式化栈\n\n## 9. Phase 5 建议：值得长期投资的 1-2 个工具\n\n**首选：cake_lpr**（trust base 最干净）\n- HOL4 → CakeML → 编译到机器码全链路形式化\n- SAT Comp 官方审计在用，工程稳定\n- 2024-2025 仍在主动优化（性能提速、binary 支持）\n- 我们 phase 5 准备阶段该做的预置工作：\n  1. 现在就把 master CP-SAT 的 SAT 内核证明开关打通（`--lrat` 或导 DRAT 走 lrat-trim 升级）\n  2. 在 artifact schema 里**预留 `proof_certificate.path / format / sha256` 字段**，但不强制\n  3. 写一个空壳 `tools/proof_audit.py`，调 cake_lpr 二进制，先跑小 instance 验证流水通\n  4. campaign 输出加可选的 `solver_trace_for_proof` 副产物（不影响 hot path）\n\n**备选：VeriPB + CakePB**（如果未来要 PB-style 证据）\n- 优点：能覆盖 CP-SAT 整模型语义（cutting plane / redundance）\n- 缺点：trust base 比 cake_lpr 大一截（VeriPB 自己未验证，靠 CakePB kernel 复核）\n- 何时切：当我们要证 master 整体最优而不只是 SAT 子核 UNSAT 时\n\n**不要投资**：\n- GPU 检查器（不存在工业级方案）\n- 自己写 LRAT 检查器（cake_lpr 已是天花板）\n- DRAT 直出（被 LRAT 全面替代，慢 6 倍）\n\n## 关键链接\n\n- CaDiCaL releases: https://github.com/arminbiere/cadical/blob/master/NEWS.md\n- lidrup-check: https://github.com/arminbiere/lidrup-check\n- cake_lpr: https://github.com/tanyongkiam/cake_lpr\n- SAT Comp 2025 cake_lpr 文档: https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/downloads/checkers/cakelpr.pdf\n- SAT Comp 2025 VeriPB/CakePB: https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/downloads/checkers/veripb.pdf\n- Pollitt/Fleury/Biere LRAT 论文: https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol271-sat2023/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.21/LIPIcs.SAT.2023.21.pdf\n- Schreiber IMPCHECK SAT'24: https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/document/10.4230/LIPIcs.SAT.2024.25\n- Fazekas/Pollitt/Fleury/Biere LIDRUP LPAR'24: https://kfazekas.github.io/papers/FazekasPollittFleuryBiere-LPAR24.pdf\n- Nukala/Bryant/Heule PBIP FMCAD'24: https://repositum.tuwien.at/bitstream/20.500.12708/200790/1/Nukala-2024-Translating%20Pseudo-Boolean%20Proofs%20into%20Boolean%20Clausal%20Proofs-vor.pdf\n- Carcara: https://github.com/ufmg-smite/carcara\n- GRAT: https://www21.in.tum.de/~lammich/grat/\n- MallobSat 2024: https://dominikschreiber.de/papers/2024-mallob.pdf"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2775,"cache_read_input_tokens":41359,"output_tokens":3903,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2775},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3903,"cache_read_input_tokens":41359,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2775,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caotmdc2Ec7FgZAPrrGGn","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef23429a-a8c9-4686-b78c-f43086c9aa8a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:10:26.358Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
